# Cloudflare Workers static-assets redirects. Rules here are authoritative:
# the GitHub Pages deploy that ignored this file was retired in #262, so a rule
# no longer needs a portable fallback page. (pages/fiftieth.jsx still carries
# one, which is now belt-and-braces plus a working `next dev` route.)
#
# Rules here are followed BEFORE any matching asset is served, so keep them
# exact — never a splat. A greedy rule in this file would shadow the whole
# site, including the /.well-known/acme-challenge path the zone's certificate
# renewal depends on.

# Vanity alias for the 50th anniversary page: wxyc.org/fiftieth
/fiftieth /50th 301
/fiftieth/ /50th 301

# iOS asks for the -precomposed variant on older devices. One icon serves both;
# components/Layout.js declares /apple-touch-icon.png for everything current.
/apple-touch-icon-precomposed.png /apple-touch-icon.png 301
